			"notes": "# New Mobs\n\nTo add the new mobs you need to delete a file manually:\n\".minecraft\\config\\drop2inv\\mobs.json\"\n\n> Added new mobs\n\n**PASSIVE**\n+ camel_husk\n+ sulfur_cube\n+ zombie_horse\n\n**NEUTRAL**\n+ pufferfish\n+ nautilus\n+ zombie_nautilus\n\n**HOSTILE**\n+ creaking\n+ parched\n\n> Modified mobs categories\n\n**REMOVED PASSIVE**\n- dolphin\n- fox\n- panda\n\n**REMOVED HOSTILE**\n- cave_spider\n- drowned\n\n**ADDED NEUTRAL**\n* cave_spider\n* dolphin\n* drowned\n* fox\n* panda\n\n---\n\n# New config entities\n\n-  Boats\n- Chest boats\n- Minecart\n- Special minecarts\n- Armor stand\n- Item frames\n\n---\n\n# New config containers\nItems inside the block/entity will go directly to the inventory when it breaks.\n\n> **Blocks**\n-  Chest\n- Trapped chest\n- Copper chests\n- Barrel\n- Dropper\n- Dispenser\n- Furnance\n- Blast furnance\n- Smoker\n- Hopper\n- Crafter\n- - Lectern (Not added)\n- Pot\n- Jukebox\n- Brewing stand\n- - Campfires (Not added)\n- Bookshelf\n- Shelves\n\n> **Entities**\n- Chest boats\n- Special minecarts\n- Armor stand\n- Item frames"
		},
